    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'You are Arthur Vance, an investigator chasing an anonymous tip about Julian
    Cross, the tower''s architect who vanished thirty years ago. Someone knocked
    you out and locked you inside. At midnight the tower seals itself for good.


    Escape
    all three rooms before the bell strikes twelve.


    WASD - move          Mouse
    - look          Shift - sprint

    E - interact / read / pick up          F
    - flashlight          Esc - pause


    Touching a moving hazard costs 30 seconds.'
